{"id":"entity/substance:air","canonical_name":"空气","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["Air","大气"],"definition":"空气是地球周围存在的无色、无气味的混合气体，主要由氮气、氧气、稀有气体、二氧化碳等成分组成，是动植物生存的必要条件和重要的自然资源。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","system"],"properties":{"state":"gas","color":"无色","odor":"无气味","composition_by_volume":{"氮气":"78%","氧气":"21%","稀有气体":"0.94%","二氧化碳":"0.03%","其他气体和杂质":"0.03%"}},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:nitrogen","canonical_name":"氮气","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["N2","Nitrogen","氮"],"definition":"氮气是一种无色、无气味的气体，难溶于水，化学性质不活泼，是空气的主要成分（约占78%）。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"N2","state":"gas","color":"无色","odor":"无气味","solubility":"难溶于水","chemical_reactivity":"不活泼"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:oxygen","canonical_name":"氧气","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["O2","Oxygen","氧"],"definition":"氧气是一种无色、无气味的气体，不易溶于水，密度略大于空气，化学性质较活泼，能支持燃烧和供给呼吸，是空气的重要成分（约占21%）。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","energy","change"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"O2","state":"gas","color":"无色","odor":"无气味","density":"1.429 g/L (0℃, 101kPa)","solubility":"不易溶于水","boiling_point":"-183℃","melting_point":"-218℃"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:rare-gases","canonical_name":"稀有气体","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["惰性气体","Noble gases","惰性元素"],"definition":"稀有气体是一类化学性质极不活泼的气体，包括氦、氖、氩、氪、氙等，在空气中含量很少（约0.94%），曾被称为惰性气体。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure"],"properties":{"state":"gas","chemical_reactivity":"极不活泼","air_content":"约0.94%"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:carbon-dioxide","canonical_name":"二氧化碳","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["CO2","Carbon dioxide","干冰"],"definition":"二氧化碳是一种无色、无气味的气体，密度比空气大，能溶于水，是空气的成分之一（约占0.03%），是植物光合作用的原料。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"CO2","state":"gas","color":"无色","odor":"无气味","air_content":"约0.03%"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:red-phosphorus","canonical_name":"红磷","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["P","Red phosphorus","磷"],"definition":"红磷是一种暗红色粉末状固体，着火点较低，能在空气中燃烧生成五氧化二磷，常用于测定空气中氧气含量的实验。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change"],"properties":{"chemical_symbol":"P","state":"solid","color":"暗红色","ignition_point":"较低"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:phosphorus-pentoxide","canonical_name":"五氧化二磷","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["P2O5","Phosphorus pentoxide"],"definition":"五氧化二磷是红磷在氧气中燃烧生成的白色固体，化学式为P2O5。","learning_modes":["factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"P2O5","state":"solid","color":"白色"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:mixture","canonical_name":"混合物","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Mixture","混合物质"],"definition":"混合物是由两种或两种以上的物质混合而成的物质，各成分保持各自的化学性质，可以用物理方法分离。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","classification"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:pure-substance","canonical_name":"纯净物","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Pure substance","纯净物质"],"definition":"纯净物是只由一种物质组成的物质，具有固定的组成和性质。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","classification"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:oxygen-content-measurement","canonical_name":"测定空气中氧气含量的实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["红磷燃烧实验","氧气含量测定"],"definition":"利用红磷燃烧消耗密闭容器内空气中的氧气，通过测量进入容器的水的体积来测定空气中氧气含量的实验方法。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","measurement","model"],"properties":{"principle":"红磷燃烧消耗氧气，容器内压强减小，水被吸入容器","key_reagent":"红磷","key_equipment":["集气瓶","量筒","燃烧匙","弹簧夹"],"experimental_conditions":["密闭装置","冷却至室温后打开弹簧夹"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"issue:air-quality","canonical_name":"空气质量","node_kind":"issue","aliases":["Air quality","大气质量","空气污染"],"definition":"空气质量是指空气的清洁程度，通常用空气质量指数（AQI）定量描述，受二氧化硫、二氧化氮、一氧化碳、臭氧、PM10、PM2.5等污染物影响。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["interaction","system","matter"],"properties":{"key_pollutants":["二氧化硫","二氧化氮","一氧化碳","臭氧","PM10","PM2.5"],"measurement_index":"空气质量指数（AQI）"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:chemistry","canonical_name":"化学","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Chemistry","化学科学"],"definition":"化学是研究物质的组成、结构、性质、变化以及与物质变化过程相伴随的能量转变的科学，是与科学、技术、社会和环境息息相关的一门自然科学。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure","change","energy"],"properties":{"research_objects":["物质的组成","物质的结构","物质的性质","物质的变化","能量转变"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:chemical-change","canonical_name":"化学变化","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["化学反应","Chemical change","Chemical reaction","化学变化"],"definition":"化学变化是生成与原来不同的物质的变化，也称为化学反应。化学反应前的原物质叫反应物，化学反应后产生的新物质叫生成物或产物。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["change","matter","energy"],"properties":{"characteristics":["生成新物质","伴随能量变化","常伴随发光、放热","常伴随产生气体","常伴随生成沉淀","常伴随颜色变化"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:physical-change","canonical_name":"物理变化","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Physical change","物理变化"],"definition":"物理变化是物质形态或形状发生变化但没有生成其他物质的变化。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["change","matter"],"properties":{"characteristics":["没有生成新物质","物质形态或形状变化"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:chemical-property","canonical_name":"化学性质","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Chemical property","化学性质"],"definition":"化学性质是物质在发生化学变化时表现出来的性质，如可燃性、酸碱性等。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change"],"properties":{"examples":["可燃性","酸碱性","氧化性","还原性"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:physical-property","canonical_name":"物理性质","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Physical property","物理性质"],"definition":"物理性质是物质不需要发生化学变化就能表现出来的性质，如颜色、气味、熔点、沸点、密度、硬度、导电性、导热性等。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","classification"],"properties":{"examples":["颜色","气味","熔点","沸点","密度","硬度","导电性","导热性"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:magnesium","canonical_name":"镁","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["Mg","Magnesium","镁带","镁条"],"definition":"镁是一种银白色金属，具有金属光泽，能在空气中燃烧发出耀眼的白光，生成白色粉末（氧化镁）。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","energy"],"properties":{"chemical_symbol":"Mg","state":"solid","color":"银白色","luster":"金属光泽","combustion_product":"氧化镁（白色粉末）"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:magnesium-oxide","canonical_name":"氧化镁","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["MgO","Magnesium oxide"],"definition":"氧化镁是镁在氧气中燃烧生成的白色粉末状固体。","learning_modes":["factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"MgO","state":"solid","color":"白色","texture":"粉末状"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:hydrogen","canonical_name":"氢气","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["H2","Hydrogen","氢"],"definition":"氢气是一种无色、无气味的气体，与氧气燃烧放出大量的热，生成物只有水，是理想的无污染燃料。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","energy","change"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"H2","state":"gas","combustion_product":"水","energy_release":"大量热"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:element","canonical_name":"元素","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Element","化学元素","元素"],"definition":"元素是组成物质的基本成分，世间万物都是由化学元素组成的。同种元素具有相同的质子数（即核电荷数）。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure","classification"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:molecule","canonical_name":"分子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["Molecule","分子"],"definition":"分子是构成物质的一种极其微小的粒子，物质的性质差异与分子的种类、数目及排列方式有关。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","model"],"properties":{"scale":"微观"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:atom","canonical_name":"原子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["Atom","原子"],"definition":"原子是构成物质的一种极其微小的粒子，是化学变化中的最小粒子。物质的性质差异与原子的种类、数目及排列方式有关。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","model"],"properties":{"scale":"微观","role_in_reaction":"化学变化中的最小粒子"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"principle:property-determines-use","canonical_name":"物质性质决定用途","node_kind":"principle","aliases":["性质决定用途","Property determines use"],"definition":"物质的用途由物质的性质决定，不同的性质决定了物质的不同用途。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","function","causality"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"principle:energy-accompanies-change","canonical_name":"化学变化伴随能量变化","node_kind":"principle","aliases":["能量守恒","Energy change in chemical reaction"],"definition":"物质发生化学变化时不但生成新物质，还会伴随着能量的变化，这种能量变化通常表现为热量、电能和光能的释放或吸收。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["energy","change","causality"],"properties":{"energy_forms":["热量","电能","光能"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:matter-change","canonical_name":"物质的变化实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["物质变化探究实验","物质变化实验"],"definition":"通过水的沸腾、维生素C泡腾片反应、镁带剪断和燃烧等实验，探究物质变化的特征，区分物理变化与化学变化。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","change","matter"],"properties":{"experiments":["水的沸腾","维生素C泡腾片反应","镁带剪断","镁带燃烧"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"representation/symbol:element-symbol","canonical_name":"元素符号","node_kind":"representation","node_subkind":"symbol","aliases":["Element symbol","元素符号"],"definition":"元素符号是用元素拉丁文名称的首字母（大写）来表示元素的符号，是化学语言的基本组成部分，具有国际通用性。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["representation","matter","model"],"properties":{"naming_rule":"拉丁文名称首字母大写","two_letter_rule":"首字母相同时附加小写字母"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"representation/formula:chemical-formula","canonical_name":"化学式","node_kind":"representation","node_subkind":"formula","aliases":["Chemical formula","分子式","化学式"],"definition":"化学式是用元素符号和数字的组合来表示物质组成的式子，如氧气用O2表示，水用H2O表示。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["representation","matter","structure"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"representation/equation:chemical-equation","canonical_name":"化学方程式","node_kind":"representation","node_subkind":"equation","aliases":["Chemical equation","反应方程式","化学方程式"],"definition":"化学方程式是用化学式来表示化学反应的式子，具有简洁、科学、国际通用的特点。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["representation","change","matter"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:chemical-language","canonical_name":"化学语言","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Chemical language","化学符号语言"],"definition":"化学语言是化学家创造的一套能够表达物质组成、结构和变化的符号体系，包括元素符号、化学式、化学方程式等，具有简明直观和国际通用的特点。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["representation","communication","model"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:molecular-model","canonical_name":"分子模型","node_kind":"method","node_subkind":"model","aliases":["Molecular model","分子模型","微观模型"],"definition":"分子模型是用于表示分子结构和原子排列方式的模型工具，是联系宏观与微观的桥梁，帮助认识和理解不能直接观察到的物质结构。","learning_modes":["conceptual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["model","structure","matter"],"properties":{"model_types":["实物搭建立体模型","电脑创作立体模型","平面形态模型"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:carbon","canonical_name":"碳","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["C","Carbon","石墨","碳"],"definition":"碳是一种非金属元素，碳元素的单质有石墨、金刚石等，是组成有机物的重要元素。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure"],"properties":{"element_symbol":"C","atomic_number":6},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:lab-safety","canonical_name":"实验室安全","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Laboratory safety","实验室安全规则","实验安全"],"definition":"实验室安全是指在化学实验室中遵守安全规则、识别安全设备和安全标志，以保证实验顺利进行和人员安全的一系列规范和措施。","learning_modes":["procedural","factual"],"bridge_tags":["safety","procedure","interaction"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:reagent-handling","canonical_name":"试剂取用","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Reagent handling","取用试剂","药品取用"],"definition":"试剂取用是化学实验的基本操作，包括固体试剂和液体试剂的取用方法，要求规范操作以保证实验准确和安全。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["procedure","measurement"],"properties":{"key_rules":["瓶塞倒放","标签朝向手心","滴管垂直悬空"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:heating","canonical_name":"加热操作","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Heating operation","加热","加热方法"],"definition":"加热操作是化学实验的基本操作之一，包括使用酒精灯给试管、烧杯等仪器加热的方法和注意事项。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["procedure","energy","change"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:test-tube","canonical_name":"试管","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Test tube","试管"],"definition":"试管是化学实验中最常用的仪器之一，用于少量试剂的反应容器，可直接加热。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter"],"properties":{"material":"玻璃","heating":"可直接加热"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:beaker","canonical_name":"烧杯","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Beaker","烧杯"],"definition":"烧杯是化学实验中常用的仪器，用于较多量试剂的反应容器，需垫石棉网加热。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter"],"properties":{"material":"玻璃","heating":"需垫石棉网"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:alcohol-lamp","canonical_name":"酒精灯","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Alcohol lamp","酒精灯"],"definition":"酒精灯是化学实验中常用的加热工具，使用酒精作为燃料，火焰温度可达500℃左右。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["energy","tool"],"properties":{"fuel":"酒精","max_temperature":"约500℃"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:water","canonical_name":"水","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["H2O","Water","水"],"definition":"水是由氢元素和氧元素组成的化合物，化学式为H2O，是一种无色、无气味、无味道的液体，是重要的溶剂和生命必需物质。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure","change","life"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"H2O","boiling_point":"100℃","freezing_point":"0℃","state_at_room_temp":"液体"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:oxidation","canonical_name":"氧化性","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Oxidation","氧化性","氧化反应"],"definition":"氧化性是指物质在化学反应中能够提供氧原子或得到电子的性质，氧气具有氧化性，能支持燃烧。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["change","matter","energy"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:solvent","canonical_name":"溶剂","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Solvent","溶剂"],"definition":"溶剂是能溶解其他物质（溶质）形成溶液的物质，水是最常用的溶剂。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","interaction"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:water-electrolysis","canonical_name":"电解水实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["Electrolysis of water","水的电解","电解水"],"definition":"电解水实验是通过电流将水分解为氢气和氧气的实验，用于证明水是由氢元素和氧元素组成的。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","change","structure"],"properties":{"products":["氢气（负极）","氧气（正极）"],"volume_ratio":"氢气:氧气 = 2:1"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:atomic-structure","canonical_name":"原子结构","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Atomic structure","原子结构"],"definition":"原子结构是指原子的内部组成，原子由原子核和核外电子构成，原子核由质子和中子构成。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","model"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:proton","canonical_name":"质子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["Proton","质子"],"definition":"质子是构成原子核的微粒之一，带一个单位正电荷，质量约为电子的1836倍。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","charge"],"properties":{"charge":"+1","relative_mass":"约1836（相对电子）"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:neutron","canonical_name":"中子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["Neutron","中子"],"definition":"中子是构成原子核的微粒之一，不带电，质量与质子相近。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter"],"properties":{"charge":"0","relative_mass":"约等于质子"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:electron","canonical_name":"电子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["Electron","电子"],"definition":"电子是构成原子的微粒，在原子核外高速运动，带一个单位负电荷，质量很小。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","charge","energy"],"properties":{"charge":"-1","relative_mass":"约1/1836（相对质子）"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"principle:mass-conservation","canonical_name":"质量守恒定律","node_kind":"principle","aliases":["Law of conservation of mass","质量守恒","物质不灭定律"],"definition":"参加化学反应的各物质的质量总和等于反应后生成的各物质的质量总和。化学反应前后，原子的种类、数目和质量都不变。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["rule","change","matter","causality"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:chemical-reaction-type","canonical_name":"化学反应类型","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Types of chemical reactions","反应类型"],"definition":"化学反应类型包括化合反应、分解反应、置换反应和复分解反应等基本类型。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["classification","change","matter"],"properties":{"types":["化合反应","分解反应","置换反应","复分解反应"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:combination-reaction","canonical_name":"化合反应","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Combination reaction","化合反应"],"definition":"化合反应是由两种或两种以上的物质生成一种新物质的化学反应，特点是多变一。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["change","matter"],"properties":{"pattern":"A + B → AB"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:decomposition-reaction","canonical_name":"分解反应","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Decomposition reaction","分解反应"],"definition":"分解反应是由一种物质生成两种或两种以上其他物质的化学反应，特点是一变多。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["change","matter"],"properties":{"pattern":"AB → A + B"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:solution","canonical_name":"溶液","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Solution","溶液"],"definition":"溶液是由溶质和溶剂组成的均一、稳定的混合物，具有均一性和稳定性两个基本特征。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","mixture","interaction"],"properties":{"characteristics":["均一性","稳定性"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:solute","canonical_name":"溶质","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Solute","溶质"],"definition":"溶质是被溶解的物质，在溶液中以分子或离子形式分散存在。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:solubility","canonical_name":"溶解度","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Solubility","溶解度"],"definition":"溶解度表示在一定温度下，某固体物质在100g溶剂里达到饱和状态时所溶解的质量，单位是克。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter","interaction"],"properties":{"unit":"g/100g溶剂"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:saturated-solution","canonical_name":"饱和溶液","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Saturated solution","饱和溶液"],"definition":"饱和溶液是在一定温度下，一定量的溶剂里不能再继续溶解某种溶质的溶液。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","measurement","limit"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:mass-fraction","canonical_name":"溶质质量分数","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Mass fraction","溶质质量分数","浓度"],"definition":"溶质质量分数是溶质质量与溶液质量之比，用于定量表示溶液的组成。","learning_modes":["conceptual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter","calculation"],"properties":{"formula":"溶质质量分数 = 溶质质量/溶液质量 × 100%"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:acid","canonical_name":"酸","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Acid","酸类","酸性物质"],"definition":"酸是电离时生成的阳离子全部是氢离子的化合物，具有酸的通性。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure","interaction"],"properties":{"examples":["盐酸","硫酸","硝酸"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:base","canonical_name":"碱","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Base","碱类","碱性物质"],"definition":"碱是电离时生成的阴离子全部是氢氧根离子的化合物，具有碱的通性。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure","interaction"],"properties":{"examples":["氢氧化钠","氢氧化钙","氢氧化钾"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:hydrochloric-acid","canonical_name":"盐酸","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["HCl","Hydrochloric acid","盐酸","氯化氢溶液"],"definition":"盐酸是氯化氢气体的水溶液，是一种常见的强酸，具有挥发性，广泛用于工业和实验室。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","interaction"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"HCl","state":"液体（溶液）","volatility":"易挥发"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:sulfuric-acid","canonical_name":"硫酸","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["H2SO4","Sulfuric acid","硫酸"],"definition":"硫酸是一种常见的强酸，具有腐蚀性、脱水性和吸水性，广泛用于工业生产。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","interaction","energy"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"H2SO4","characteristics":["强腐蚀性","脱水性","吸水性"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:sodium-hydroxide","canonical_name":"氢氧化钠","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["NaOH","Sodium hydroxide","烧碱","火碱","苛性钠"],"definition":"氢氧化钠是一种常见的强碱，俗名烧碱、火碱、苛性钠，易溶于水并放热，具有强腐蚀性。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","interaction"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"NaOH","state":"固体","solubility":"易溶于水","dissolution_heat":"放热"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:combustion","canonical_name":"燃烧","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Combustion","燃烧","着火"],"definition":"燃烧是可燃物与氧气发生的一种发光、放热的剧烈的氧化反应，需要同时满足三个条件才能发生。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["change","energy","matter","interaction"],"properties":{"conditions":["可燃物","氧气（助燃物）","温度达到着火点"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:ignition-point","canonical_name":"着火点","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Ignition point","着火点","燃点"],"definition":"着火点是使可燃物燃烧所需的最低温度，不同物质的着火点不同。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["energy","matter","measurement"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:graduated-cylinder","canonical_name":"量筒","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Graduated cylinder","Measuring cylinder","量杯"],"definition":"量筒是实验室用于量取一定体积液体的量器，有不同规格，不可受热，读数时视线应与凹液面最低处保持水平。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter"],"properties":{"material":"玻璃","reading_rule":"视线与凹液面最低处水平","heating":"不可受热"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:dropper","canonical_name":"胶头滴管","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Dropper","Rubber bulb dropper","滴管","胶帽滴管"],"definition":"胶头滴管是用于吸取和滴加少量液体的仪器，使用时应竖直悬于容器上方，不可伸入容器内或触碰器壁，不可平放或倒拿。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter"],"properties":{"structure":"胶帽和玻璃管组成","usage":"吸取和滴加少量液体"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:funnel","canonical_name":"漏斗","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Funnel","玻璃漏斗"],"definition":"漏斗是用于分离固体和液体的仪器，主要用于过滤操作，使用时滤纸应紧贴漏斗内壁，漏斗颈末端应紧靠承接容器内壁。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter"],"properties":{"material":"玻璃","usage":"分离固体和液体"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:evaporating-dish","canonical_name":"蒸发皿","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Evaporating dish","蒸发器"],"definition":"蒸发皿是用于蒸发液体的仪器，一般为陶瓷材质，可直接用酒精灯加热，加热时需用玻璃棒不断搅拌以防液体飞溅。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["energy","matter","change"],"properties":{"material":"陶瓷","heating":"可直接加热","usage":"蒸发液体"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:iron-stand","canonical_name":"铁架台","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Iron stand","Ring stand","铁架台","铁支架"],"definition":"铁架台是用于固定和支撑实验仪器的装置，配铁夹可用于固定试管、烧瓶等仪器，配铁圈可放置漏斗、蒸发皿、烧杯等仪器。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["structure","measurement"],"properties":{"components":["铁架台主体","铁夹","铁圈"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:glass-rod","canonical_name":"玻璃棒","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Glass rod","Stirring rod","玻璃棒","搅拌棒"],"definition":"玻璃棒是用于搅拌、引流和转移液体的玻璃制实验仪器，在溶解、过滤、蒸发等操作中起重要作用。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter"],"properties":{"material":"玻璃","uses":["搅拌","引流","转移液体"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:reagent-bottle","canonical_name":"试剂瓶","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Reagent bottle","试剂瓶","广口瓶","细口瓶","滴瓶"],"definition":"试剂瓶是用于存放化学试剂的容器，固体试剂存放于广口瓶中，液体试剂存放于细口瓶中，临时使用少量液体试剂常用滴瓶存放。","learning_modes":["factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure"],"properties":{"types":["广口瓶(固体)","细口瓶(液体)","滴瓶(少量液体)"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:electronic-balance","canonical_name":"电子天平","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Electronic balance","电子秤","电子天平"],"definition":"电子天平是用于称量固体质量的精密仪器，初中化学实验常用分度值为0.1g的电子天平，称量时需在秤盘上放置称量纸。","learning_modes":["procedural","factual"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter"],"properties":{"precision":"分度值0.1g(常用)","operation":"去皮称量"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/equipment:test-tube-holder","canonical_name":"试管夹","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"equipment","aliases":["Test tube holder","Test tube clamp","试管夹"],"definition":"试管夹是用于夹持试管进行加热的仪器，应从试管底部套上，夹在接近试管口的部位，试管夹的短臂朝上。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","energy"],"properties":{"usage":"夹持试管加热","position":"夹在接近试管口部位"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:filtration","canonical_name":"过滤操作","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Filtration","过滤","过滤法"],"definition":"过滤是分离固体和液体的常用方法，通过滤纸将不溶性固体与液体分离，需遵循一贴二低三靠的操作规范。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","measurement","change"],"properties":{"key_rules":["滤纸紧贴漏斗内壁","液面低于滤纸边缘","玻璃棒靠三层滤纸","漏斗颈靠烧杯内壁"],"purpose":"分离难溶性杂质与液体"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:evaporation","canonical_name":"蒸发操作","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Evaporation","蒸发","蒸发法"],"definition":"蒸发是通过加热使液体汽化逸出从而得到固体物质的实验方法，常用蒸发皿和酒精灯进行，加热时需用玻璃棒不断搅拌。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","energy","change"],"properties":{"key_rules":["加热时不断搅拌防止飞溅","出现较多固体时停止加热","利用余热蒸干"],"purpose":"从溶液中获取固体物质"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:coarse-salt-purification","canonical_name":"粗盐提纯实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["去除粗盐中难溶性杂质","粗盐中难溶性杂质的去除","粗盐提纯"],"definition":"粗盐提纯实验是通过溶解、过滤、蒸发三个主要步骤去除粗盐中难溶性杂质的实验，用于学习基本的化学实验操作技能。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","measurement","procedure"],"properties":{"main_steps":["溶解","过滤","蒸发"],"objective":"去除粗盐中的难溶性杂质"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:sodium-chloride","canonical_name":"氯化钠","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["NaCl","Sodium chloride","食盐","精盐","食盐"],"definition":"氯化钠是一种白色固体，是食盐的主要成分，易溶于水，是人体必需的物质，在实验室中常用于配制溶液和粗盐提纯实验。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","life"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"NaCl","state":"固体","color":"白色","solubility":"易溶于水"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:chemical-experiment-inquiry","canonical_name":"化学实验探究","node_kind":"method","aliases":["化学实验探究","实验探究","科学探究","Chemical experiment inquiry"],"definition":"化学实验探究是以问题为起点，通过形成假设、设计实验方案、实施实验获取证据、分析数据、形成结论、建构模型、反思评价和表达交流等步骤，进行科学发现和知识建构的活动过程。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","model","change","interaction"],"properties":{"process_steps":["提出问题","形成假设","设计实验方案","实施实验获取证据","分析解释数据","形成结论及建构模型","反思评价及表达交流"],"key_elements":["问题","假设","实验方案","证据","结论"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:experiment-report","canonical_name":"实验报告","node_kind":"method","aliases":["实验报告","Experiment report","探究报告"],"definition":"实验报告是描述、记录、讨论某项实验或探究的过程和结果的报告，通过实验报告展示活动的完整过程，是养成严谨科学态度和实事求是科学精神的重要环节。","learning_modes":["procedural","metacognitive"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","representation","model"],"properties":{"components":["实验主题","实验目的","实验原理","实验仪器","实验试剂","实验步骤与现象记录","实验结论","讨论与拓展","反思与评价"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:candle-combustion","canonical_name":"蜡烛燃烧及其产物的探究实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["蜡烛燃烧实验","蜡烛产物探究","Candle combustion experiment"],"definition":"蜡烛燃烧及其产物的探究实验是通过观察蜡烛及其燃烧过程，收集火焰上方气体，验证蜡烛燃烧生成水蒸气和二氧化碳的实验探究活动，是学习化学实验探究一般过程的典型案例。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","change","matter","model"],"properties":{"main_steps":["观察蜡烛物理性质","观察蜡烛燃烧过程","收集火焰上方气体","用干燥锥形瓶检验水蒸气","用澄清石灰水检验二氧化碳"],"key_observations":["瓶壁有水雾说明产生水蒸气","木条熄灭说明氧气含量低","石灰水变浑浊说明产生二氧化碳"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:candle","canonical_name":"蜡烛","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["Candle","蜡烛"],"definition":"蜡烛是一种可燃性固体物质，通常由石蜡制成，燃烧时发光发热，燃烧产物主要包括水蒸气和二氧化碳。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","energy","change"],"properties":{"state":"固体","combustibility":"可燃","main_component":"石蜡"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:calcium-hydroxide","canonical_name":"氢氧化钙","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["Ca(OH)2","Calcium hydroxide","石灰水","熟石灰","消石灰","澄清石灰水"],"definition":"氢氧化钙是一种白色粉末状固体，微溶于水，其水溶液俗称石灰水，呈碱性，能与二氧化碳反应生成碳酸钙沉淀，使澄清石灰水变浑浊，常用于检验二氧化碳。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","interaction"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"Ca(OH)2","state":"固体（粉末）","color":"白色","solubility":"微溶于水","solution_name":"石灰水","solution_property":"碱性"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:hypothesis","canonical_name":"假设","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Hypothesis","科学假设","实验假设"],"definition":"假设是根据已有知识和实验现象，对研究问题提出的初步解释或预测，需要通过实验验证其正确性，是科学探究过程中的重要环节。","learning_modes":["conceptual","metacognitive"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","model","causality"],"properties":{},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T14:00:00+08:00"}
