{"id":"entity/substance:carbonic-acid","canonical_name":"碳酸","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["H2CO3","Carbonic acid","碳酸"],"definition":"碳酸是二氧化碳与水反应生成的弱酸，化学式为H2CO3，能使紫色石蕊试液变红。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","interaction"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"H2CO3","acidity":"弱酸","indicator_reaction":"使紫色石蕊试液变红"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:oxygen-properties","canonical_name":"氧气性质实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["氧气化学性质实验","木炭铁丝燃烧实验","Oxygen properties experiment"],"definition":"通过木炭在氧气中燃烧和铁丝在氧气中燃烧等实验，探究氧气的化学性质，认识氧气具有氧化性，能支持燃烧。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","change","matter"],"properties":{"experiments":["木炭在氧气中燃烧","铁丝在氧气中燃烧"],"key_observations":["木炭在氧气中燃烧发出白光","铁丝在氧气中燃烧火星四射","铁丝在空气中很难燃烧"],"safety_notes":["铁丝燃烧时集气瓶底部放水或细沙"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:oxygen-cycle","canonical_name":"氧循环","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Oxygen cycle","自然界氧循环","氧循环"],"definition":"氧循环是指氧气在自然界中通过生物呼吸、燃烧、光合作用等过程不断循环的过程，对维持生态平衡具有重要意义。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["change","system","matter","interaction"],"properties":{"key_processes":["生物呼吸消耗氧气","物质燃烧消耗氧气","植物光合作用产生氧气","自然界中氧气含量相对稳定"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:carbon-cycle","canonical_name":"碳循环","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Carbon cycle","自然界碳循环","碳循环"],"definition":"碳循环是指碳元素在自然界中通过生物呼吸、燃烧、光合作用等过程不断循环的过程，二氧化碳是碳循环的重要载体。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["change","system","matter","interaction"],"properties":{"key_processes":["生物呼吸产生二氧化碳","物质燃烧产生二氧化碳","植物光合作用吸收二氧化碳","自然界中碳元素循环"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"issue:greenhouse-effect","canonical_name":"温室效应","node_kind":"issue","aliases":["Greenhouse effect","温室效应","全球变暖"],"definition":"温室效应是指大气中的二氧化碳等温室气体吸收地表辐射的热量，导致地球表面温度升高的现象，人类活动排放的二氧化碳是温室效应加剧的主要原因。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["interaction","system","matter","environment"],"properties":{"main_cause":"二氧化碳等温室气体排放增加","impact":"全球气候变暖","response":"减少二氧化碳排放，开发清洁能源"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:potassium-permanganate","canonical_name":"高锰酸钾","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["KMnO4","Potassium permanganate","PP粉","灰锰氧"],"definition":"高锰酸钾是一种暗紫色固体，加热时可分解生成锰酸钾、二氧化锰和氧气，是实验室制取氧气的常用原料之一。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","energy"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"KMnO4","state":"solid","color":"暗紫色","decomposition_products":["锰酸钾","二氧化锰","氧气"],"decomposition_condition":"加热"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:manganese-dioxide","canonical_name":"二氧化锰","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["MnO2","Manganese dioxide","锰矿"],"definition":"二氧化锰是一种黑色粉末状固体，常用作氯酸钾分解和过氧化氢分解制取氧气的催化剂，在反应前后质量和化学性质不变。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","energy"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"MnO2","state":"solid","color":"黑色","catalytic_role":"催化剂","catalyzed_reactions":["过氧化氢分解","氯酸钾分解"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
