{"id":"entity/substance:calcium-carbonate","canonical_name":"碳酸钙","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["CaCO3","Calcium carbonate","石灰石","大理石","大理石","石灰石"],"definition":"碳酸钙是一种白色固体，是石灰石和大理石的主要成分，与稀盐酸反应可制取二氧化碳，是实验室制取二氧化碳的常用原料。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","interaction"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"CaCO3","state":"solid","color":"白色","natural_forms":["石灰石","大理石"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
