{"id":"concept:catalyst","canonical_name":"催化剂","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Catalyst","催化作用","触媒"],"definition":"在化学反应中，能够改变化学反应的速率而本身的质量和化学性质在反应前后均不发生变化的物质叫做催化剂。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["change","matter","causality"],"properties":{"characteristics":["改变化学反应速率","质量和化学性质反应前后不变"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:gas-collection-water-displacement","canonical_name":"排水法","node_kind":"method","aliases":["排水集气法","Water displacement method","排水法"],"definition":"排水法是收集难溶或微溶于水且不与水发生化学反应的气体的方法，收集的气体纯度高但含有一定量水分。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter","procedure"],"properties":{"applicable_conditions":["气体难溶或微溶于水","气体不与水发生化学反应"],"advantages":["气体纯度高","容易观察是否收集满"],"disadvantages":["收集的气体含有水分"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:gas-collection-upward-air","canonical_name":"向上排空气法","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Upward air displacement method","向上排空气法","排空气法（向上）"],"definition":"向上排空气法是收集密度比空气大的气体的方法，适用于不与空气反应且密度明显大于空气的气体。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter","procedure"],"properties":{"applicable_condition":"气体密度比空气大且不与空气反应","examples":["二氧化碳","氧气"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:gas-collection-downward-air","canonical_name":"向下排空气法","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Downward air displacement method","向下排空气法","排空气法（向下）"],"definition":"向下排空气法是收集密度比空气小的气体的方法，适用于不与空气反应且密度明显小于空气的气体。","learning_modes":["procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter","procedure"],"properties":{"applicable_condition":"气体密度比空气小且不与空气反应","examples":["氢气","氨气"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:laboratory-gas-preparation","canonical_name":"实验室制取气体的一般思路与方法","node_kind":"method","aliases":["制取气体思路","气体制备方法","Laboratory gas preparation method"],"definition":"实验室制取气体的一般思路包括：确定反应原理、选择发生装置、选择收集装置。发生装置依据反应物状态和反应条件确定，收集装置依据气体的密度与空气密度的相对大小、气体在水中的溶解性确定。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["procedure","matter","model","evidence"],"properties":{"key_steps":["确定反应原理","选择发生装置","选择收集装置"],"device_selection_factors":{"发生装置":["反应物状态","反应条件"],"收集装置":["气体密度与空气的相对大小","气体在水中的溶解性"]}},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:industrial-oxygen-preparation","canonical_name":"工业制氧气","node_kind":"method","aliases":["分离液态空气法","工业制氧","Industrial oxygen preparation"],"definition":"工业制氧气采用分离液态空气的方法，在低温和高压条件下，利用液态空气中氮气沸点较低先汽化的原理，分离出液态氧。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","energy","procedure","measurement"],"properties":{"principle":"利用氮气和氧气沸点不同","conditions":["低温","高压"],"process":"液态氮先汽化，留下液态氧"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:oxygen-lab-preparation","canonical_name":"实验室制取氧气实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["制取氧气实验","氧气制备实验","Oxygen laboratory preparation"],"definition":"实验室制取氧气的实验包括加热高锰酸钾分解法、过氧化氢分解法和加热氯酸钾分解法，通过排水法或向上排空气法收集氧气。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","matter","change","procedure"],"properties":{"methods":["加热高锰酸钾分解","过氧化氢分解（二氧化锰催化）","加热氯酸钾分解（二氧化锰催化）"],"collection_methods":["排水法","向上排空气法"],"safety_notes":["实验结束先移导管再熄灯","试管口放玻璃棉防止粉末进入导管"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:co2-lab-preparation","canonical_name":"实验室制取二氧化碳实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["制取二氧化碳实验","二氧化碳制备实验","CO2 laboratory preparation"],"definition":"实验室制取二氧化碳实验是用石灰石或大理石（主要成分碳酸钙）与稀盐酸反应，采用向上排空气法收集二氧化碳气体。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","matter","change","procedure"],"properties":{"reactants":["石灰石或大理石","稀盐酸"],"reaction_principle":"碳酸钙与盐酸反应","collection_method":"向上排空气法","verification":"燃着的火柴或木条放在集气瓶口熄灭表示收集满"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T18:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:calcium-oxide","canonical_name":"氧化钙","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["CaO","Calcium oxide","生石灰","石灰"],"definition":"氧化钙是一种白色固体，俗称生石灰，与水剧烈反应生成氢氧化钙并放出大量热，具有强腐蚀性。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","energy"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"CaO","state":"solid","color":"白色","reactivity":"与水剧烈反应放热","corrosivity":"强腐蚀性"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:states-of-matter","canonical_name":"物质的三态","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["States of matter","物质三态","物态","三态变化"],"definition":"物质通常有三种存在状态：固态、液态和气态。物质的三态变化是由于温度变化导致分子能量、运动速率和分子间间隔发生改变的结果，是物理变化。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","energy","model"],"properties":{"three_states":["固态","液态","气态"],"change_nature":"物理变化","change_cause":"温度变化导致分子能量、运动速率和分子间间隔改变"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:anomalous-expansion","canonical_name":"水的反常膨胀","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Anomalous expansion of water","水反常膨胀","水的密度反常"],"definition":"水的反常膨胀是指水在0~4℃时随温度升高体积减小，在4℃时密度最大（1 g/cm³）的特性，这使得冰的密度比水小，冰能浮在水面上。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","structure","energy"],"properties":{"temperature_range":"0~4℃","density_maximum":"4℃时密度最大，为1 g/cm³","significance":"冰浮在水面上，保护水生生物"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:specific-heat-capacity","canonical_name":"比热容","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Specific heat capacity","比热","热容"],"definition":"比热容是反映物质吸热或散热能力的物理量，比热容越大，物质的吸热或散热能力越强。水的比热容较大，因此常用水取暖或做冷却剂。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["energy","matter","measurement"],"properties":{"definition":"单位质量物质升高1℃所吸收的热量","water_property":"水的比热容较大","application":"用水取暖或做冷却剂"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:water-calcium-oxide-reaction","canonical_name":"水与氧化钙反应实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["生石灰与水反应实验","氧化钙与水反应","Water and calcium oxide reaction experiment"],"definition":"通过将水滴入氧化钙中观察反应现象，验证水与氧化钙发生剧烈反应放出大量热并生成氢氧化钙的实验。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","change","matter","energy"],"properties":{"phenomena":["剧烈反应","放出大量热","生成白色粉末状物质"],"product":"氢氧化钙（熟石灰）","verification":"酚酞试液变红说明生成碱性物质"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T20:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"process:water-cycle","canonical_name":"水循环","node_kind":"process","aliases":["Water cycle","自然界水循环","水的循环","水文循环"],"definition":"水循环是水在太阳辐射和地球引力作用下，通过蒸发、水汽输送、降水和径流等环节，以气体、液体、固体的形式在陆地、海洋以及大气间不断循环的过程。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["system","change","matter","energy"],"properties":{"key_processes":["蒸发","水汽输送","降水","径流"],"driving_forces":["太阳辐射","地球引力"],"forms":["气态","液态","固态"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"process:water-natural-purification","canonical_name":"水的自然净化","node_kind":"process","aliases":["Natural water purification","水体自净","水自然净化","水的自净"],"definition":"水的自然净化是水在循环过程中，通过物理、化学和生物作用不断去除污浊和杂质，保持水体洁净的过程，主要包括稀释、挥发、过滤、沉淀、吸附、氧化、分解和微生物降解等途径。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["system","change","matter","interaction"],"properties":{"pathways":["稀释","挥发","过滤","沉淀","吸附","氧化","分解","微生物降解"],"mechanism":"物理、化学和生物作用综合作用"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:self-purification-capacity","canonical_name":"水体自净能力","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Self-purification capacity","水体自净能力","自净能力"],"definition":"水体自净能力是指水体通过物理、化学和生物作用去除污染物的能力，但这种能力是有限的，当污染物数量超过水体自净能力时，水体就会受到污染。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["system","matter","limit"],"properties":{"limitation":"自净能力有限","consequence_of_exceeding":"水体污染"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:dissolved-oxygen","canonical_name":"溶解氧","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Dissolved oxygen","DO","水中溶解氧"],"definition":"溶解氧是指溶解于水中的氧气质量，是衡量水质的重要指标之一，也是水体净化的标志。水生生物依靠溶解在水中的氧气呼吸。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","measurement","life"],"properties":{"importance":["衡量水质的重要指标","水体净化的标志","水生生物呼吸所必需"],"unit":"mg/L"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:distillation","canonical_name":"蒸馏","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Distillation","蒸馏法","蒸馏操作"],"definition":"蒸馏是分离和提纯液态混合物的常用方法，通过加热使液体汽化，再冷凝为液体，可以把沸点不同的物质从混合物中分离出来，也可以去除液体中的杂质。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change","energy","measurement"],"properties":{"principle":"利用沸点差异分离物质","applications":["制取蒸馏水","海水淡化","分离液态混合物","提纯物质"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:adsorption","canonical_name":"吸附","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Adsorption","吸附法","吸附作用"],"definition":"吸附是利用多孔性固体（如活性炭）吸附水中杂质的方法，是净化水的常用方法之一，属于物理变化。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","interaction"],"properties":{"common_adsorbents":["活性炭"],"mechanism":"多孔性固体吸附杂质","change_type":"物理变化"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"method:sedimentation","canonical_name":"沉降","node_kind":"method","aliases":["Sedimentation","沉淀法","沉降法"],"definition":"沉降是使水中悬浮物在重力作用下沉淀下来的方法，常用净水剂（如明矾、氯化铁）使微小悬浮物聚集沉降，是净化水的常用方法之一。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","change"],"properties":{"common_agents":["明矾","氯化铁"],"principle":"重力作用使悬浮物沉淀","purpose":"去除微小悬浮物"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:hard-water","canonical_name":"硬水","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Hard water","硬水"],"definition":"硬水是指溶有较多可溶性含钙元素或镁元素物质的水，使用硬水会给生活和生产带来许多麻烦，需要进行软化处理后使用。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","classification","interaction"],"properties":{"characteristic":"含有较多钙、镁离子","problems":["形成水垢","影响洗涤效果","影响工业生产"],"treatment":"软化处理"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:soft-water","canonical_name":"软水","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Soft water","软水"],"definition":"软水是指不含或含较少可溶性含钙元素或镁元素物质的水，与硬水相对。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["matter","classification"],"properties":{"characteristic":"不含或含较少钙、镁离子","advantages":["不形成水垢","洗涤效果好"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:activated-carbon","canonical_name":"活性炭","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["Activated carbon","活性炭","木炭"],"definition":"活性炭是一种多孔性黑色固体，具有极强的吸附能力，常用于净化水、净化空气和吸附有毒气体，其吸附作用属于物理变化。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","interaction"],"properties":{"color":"黑色","texture":"多孔性","key_property":"吸附性强","adsorption_type":"物理吸附"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/substance:alum","canonical_name":"明矾","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"substance","aliases":["Alum","KAl(SO4)2·12H2O","十二水合硫酸铝钾","白矾"],"definition":"明矾是一种常用的净水剂，化学式为KAl(SO4)2·12H2O，溶于水后可形成胶体，吸附水中微小悬浮物使其沉降，从而达到净水目的。","learning_modes":["factual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["matter","interaction"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"KAl(SO4)2·12H2O","function":"净水剂","mechanism":"形成胶体吸附悬浮物"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"issue:water-shortage","canonical_name":"水资源短缺","node_kind":"issue","aliases":["Water shortage","水资源匮乏","淡水危机","缺水问题"],"definition":"水资源短缺是指可利用的淡水资源不足以满足人类生活、生产和生态需要的状况。我国人均水资源量不足世界人均水资源量的四分之一，是水资源严重短缺的国家，且水资源分布不均匀。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["system","matter","interaction"],"properties":{"china_status":"人均水资源量不足世界人均四分之一","distribution_problem":"南方水多、北方水少","solutions":["海水淡化","节约用水","污水处理再利用","跨流域调水"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"activity/experiment:distilled-water-preparation","canonical_name":"实验室制取蒸馏水实验","node_kind":"activity","node_subkind":"experiment","aliases":["制取蒸馏水实验","蒸馏水制备实验","Distilled water preparation experiment"],"definition":"实验室制取蒸馏水实验是通过蒸馏自来水获得纯净蒸馏水的实验，利用蒸馏方法分离液态混合物和去除杂质，是学习蒸馏原理的重要实验。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["evidence","matter","change","procedure"],"properties":{"principle":"蒸馏分离液态混合物","key_equipment":["蒸馏烧瓶","冷凝管","酒精灯","接液管"],"key_steps":["加热自来水至沸腾","水蒸气经冷凝管冷凝","收集蒸馏水"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T22:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:molecular-change-in-reaction","canonical_name":"化学变化中分子与原子的变化","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["分子变化","原子重新组合","化学变化微观本质","分子分解与重组"],"definition":"在化学变化中，反应物的分子可分成原子，而原子又会重新组合成新的分子，这是化学变化的微观本质。原子是化学变化中的最小粒子。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","change","model"],"properties":{"key_points":["分子可分成原子","原子重新组合成新分子","原子是化学变化中最小粒子"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:water-molecule","canonical_name":"水分子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["H2O分子","Water molecule","水分子"],"definition":"水分子是构成水的微观粒子，每个水分子由两个氢原子和一个氧原子构成，化学式为H2O。大量水分子聚集形成水。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","model"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"H2O","composition":"2个氢原子 + 1个氧原子","scale":"微观"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:hydrogen-molecule","canonical_name":"氢分子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["H2分子","Hydrogen molecule","氢分子"],"definition":"氢分子是构成氢气的微观粒子，由两个氢原子构成，化学式为H2，是双原子分子。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","model"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"H2","composition":"2个氢原子","molecule_type":"双原子分子","scale":"微观"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:oxygen-molecule","canonical_name":"氧分子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["O2分子","Oxygen molecule","氧分子"],"definition":"氧分子是构成氧气的微观粒子，由两个氧原子构成，化学式为O2，是双原子分子。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","model"],"properties":{"chemical_formula":"O2","composition":"2个氧原子","molecule_type":"双原子分子","scale":"微观"},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T23:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:ion","canonical_name":"离子","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["Ion","离子","正离子","负离子","阳离子","阴离子"],"definition":"离子是带电的原子或原子团，是构成物质的一种微观粒子。原子失去电子带正电荷形成正离子（阳离子），原子得到电子带负电荷形成负离子（阴离子）。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","charge"],"properties":{"formation":"原子得失电子形成","types":["正离子（阳离子）","负离子（阴离子）","原子团离子"],"examples":["钠离子(Na+)","氯离子(Cl-)","碳酸根(CO3²⁻)","氢氧根(OH⁻)","铵根(NH₄⁺)"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:relative-atomic-mass","canonical_name":"相对原子质量","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Relative atomic mass","相对原子质量","原子量"],"definition":"相对原子质量是以一个碳原子（¹²C）质量的1/12作为标准，任何原子的实际质量与这个标准之间的比值。相对原子质量是一个相对值，没有单位。","learning_modes":["conceptual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter","structure"],"properties":{"standard":"碳-12原子质量的1/12","unit":"无单位（相对值）","typical_range":"约1至300"],"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:relative-molecular-mass","canonical_name":"相对分子质量","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Relative molecular mass","相对分子质量","分子量"],"definition":"相对分子质量是表示分子质量相对大小的量，等于构成分子的各个原子的相对原子质量的总和。","learning_modes":["conceptual","procedural"],"bridge_tags":["measurement","matter","structure"],"properties":{"calculation":"各原子相对原子质量之和","unit":"无单位（相对值）"],"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:electron-shell","canonical_name":"电子层","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Electron shell","电子层","核外电子排布"],"definition":"电子层是原子核外电子运动区域的分层表示。离核最近的电子层称为第一层，其余由近及远依次为第二、三、四、五、六、七电子层，离核最远的常称为最外层。","learning_modes":["conceptual","factual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","model"],"properties":{"layers":["第一层","第二层","第三层","第四层","第五层","第六层","第七层"],"outermost_rule":"最外层电子数不超过8个（只有一层时不超过2个）"],"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"concept:stable-structure","canonical_name":"稳定结构","node_kind":"concept","aliases":["Stable electron structure","稳定结构","八电子稳定结构"],"definition":"稳定结构是指原子最外层电子数为8个（只有一个电子层时为2个）的电子排布状态，如氖、氩等稀有气体原子的电子结构。原子在化学反应中趋向于达到稳定结构。","learning_modes":["conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter","change"],"properties":{"condition":"最外层电子数为8个（或第一层为2个）","examples":["氖原子(Ne)最外层8个电子","氩原子(Ar)最外层8个电子"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"representation/diagram:atomic-structure","canonical_name":"原子结构示意图","node_kind":"representation","node_subkind":"diagram","aliases":["Atomic structure diagram","原子结构示意图","电子排布图"],"definition":"原子结构示意图是用简明方式表示原子核外电子分层排布的图示方法。图中用圆圈表示电子层，圈内数字表示原子核内的质子数，圆圈上的数字表示该层电子数。","learning_modes":["procedural","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["representation","structure","model"],"properties":{"elements":["原子核（质子数）","电子层","各层电子数"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
{"id":"entity/particle:atomic-group","canonical_name":"原子团","node_kind":"entity","node_subkind":"particle","aliases":["Atomic group","原子团","根","原子团离子"],"definition":"原子团是由两个或两个以上原子结合而成的原子集团，在化学反应中通常作为一个整体参与反应。带电的原子团称为根离子，如碳酸根、氢氧根、铵根等。","learning_modes":["factual","conceptual"],"bridge_tags":["structure","matter"],"properties":{"common_groups":["碳酸根(CO3²⁻)","氢氧根(OH⁻)","铵根(NH₄⁺)","硫酸根(SO4²⁻)","硝酸根(NO₃⁻)"]},"status":"active","created_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:00:00+08:00"}
